<title>USA: Heartland Wireless CEO David Webb resigns.</title>
<headline>Heartland Wireless CEO David Webb resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS Wireless Systems Inc on Thursday said David Webb has resigned as president and chief executive officer at Heartland Wireless Communications Inc to assume the same titles at CS Wireless, which Heartland co-owns with CAI Wireless Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Webb replaces Lowell Hussey at CS Wireless. Hussey and company officials are discussing his future role at CS, the company said.</p>
</text>
